  "userRequest": "## Summary\n\nThe cycle that built plan `3d-rendering-and-animation-simbiguity-anim-simbiguity-render-a-webgl2-executor-and-the-3d-circuit-view` closed with this follow-up open on a file it changed:\n\n> WebGL2Executor's GL calls and demo.js's history.replaceState hash write have no observing unit test; they are observed only by the seven captured circuit-3d scenarios.\n\nRe-read the completed plan and the current code before planning: the rest of that plan has shipped.",
